# AI-Powered Learning and Study Management Platform

## Overview

This is a web application designed to help students manage their studies in one place. It combines study management, collaboration, and AI-based learning assistance.

## Main Features

- User Registration & Login
- Study Notes – Create, Edit and Delete
- Task Management
- Study Planner
- Study Groups
- Real-Time Group Chat
- AI Study Assistant
- AI Quiz Generator
- Streamlit Analytics Dashboard

## Technology Stack

- Frontend: React.js, Tailwind CSS
- Backend: Node.js, Express.js
- Database: MongoDB
- AI Service: Python, FastAPI, Gemini
- Real-Time Chat: Socket.IO
- Dashboard: Streamlit

## How It Works

The student uses the React frontend. The frontend communicates with the Node.js/Express backend, which manages the application data in MongoDB. AI-related requests are handled by the Python/FastAPI AI service. Socket.IO provides real-time group chat, while Streamlit is used for the analytics dashboard.

## Purpose

The purpose of this project is to provide students with one platform where they can manage their studies, collaborate with others, and get AI-based learning support.

## Author
## Streamlit Dashboard

Streamlit is used for the project's separate analytics dashboard.
It helps display study-related data and visualizations in an easy-to-understand way.

The main web application is built with React, while Streamlit is used specifically for the analytics dashboard.

